  GOLD -->|"published approved snapshot"| VIEW
  CTRL -.->|"reconcile exact approved digest, UC grants, tool selectors"| GATE
  POLICY -.->|"per-request status check; fail closed"| BACK
  SEC -.->|"least privilege / encrypted access"| LAND

